\",并一路继续,直到安装完成.</span>":[34,35],"#<span style='color:#1E4E79'>安装功能</span>#<span style='color:#2E75B5'>3. 在\"功能\"页选\"故障转移群集\",并一路继续,直到安装完成.</span>#{1}":[35,35],"#<span style='color:#1E4E79'>配置DNS</span>":[36,54],"#<span style='color:#1E4E79'>配置DNS</span>#{1}":[37,37],"#<span style='color:#1E4E79'>配置DNS</span>#<span style='color:#2E75B5'>1. 点这里进DNS管理器</span>":[38,39],"#<span style='color:#1E4E79'>配置DNS</span>#<span style='color:#2E75B5'>1. 点这里进DNS管理器</span>#{1}":[39,39],"#<span style='color:#1E4E79'>配置DNS</span>#<span style='color:#2E75B5'>2. 新建区域</span>":[40,45],"#<span style='color:#1E4E79'>配置DNS</span>#<span style='color:#2E75B5'>2. 新建区域</span>#{1}":[41,45],"#<span style='color:#1E4E79'>配置DNS</span>#<span style='color:#2E75B5'>3. 添加所有设备的DNS信息</span>":[46,52],"#<span style='color:#1E4E79'>配置DNS</span>#<span style='color:#2E75B5'>3. 添加所有设备的DNS信息</span>#{1}":[47,52],"#<span style='color:#1E4E79'>配置DNS</span>#<span style='color:#2E75B5'>4. 修改本机的DNS服务器ip指向自己</span>":[53,54],"#<span style='color:#1E4E79'>配置DNS</span>#<span style='color:#2E75B5'>4. 修改本机的DNS服务器ip指向自己</span>#{1}":[54,54],"#<span style='color:#1E4E79'>配置计算机名称</span>":[55,66],"#<span style='color:#1E4E79'>配置计算机名称</span>#{1}":[56,66],"#<span style='color:#1E4E79'>创建故障转移群集,并添加设备.</span>":[67,84],"#<span style='color:#1E4E79'>创建故障转移群集,并添加设备.</span>#{1}":[68,68],"#<span style='color:#1E4E79'>创建故障转移群集,并添加设备.</span>#<span style='color:#2E75B5'>1. 在这打开\"故障转移群集管理器\"</span>":[69,70],"#<span style='color:#1E4E79'>创建故障转移群集,并添加设备.</span>#<span style='color:#2E75B5'>1. 在这打开\"故障转移群集管理器\"</span>#{1}":[70,70],"#<span style='color:#1E4E79'>创建故障转移群集,并添加设备.</span>#<span style='color:#2E75B5'>2. 点创建群集</span>":[71,72],"#<span style='color:#1E4E79'>创建故障转移群集,并添加设备.</span>#<span style='color:#2E75B5'>2. 点创建群集</span>#{1}":[72,72],"#<span style='color:#1E4E79'>创建故障转移群集,并添加设备.</span>#<span style='color:#2E75B5'>3. 输入三个服务器域名,点\"添加\"</span>":[73,75],"#<span style='color:#1E4E79'>创建故障转移群集,并添加设备.</span>#<span style='color:#2E75B5'>3. 输入三个